{# Blue River Live strip — every page, everyone (not geo-gated).
   The slot is a fixed-height box in the initial HTML holding a static link, so
   it is never a hole and hydration never moves anything: base.njk swaps the
   link's contents for the newest post (thumb, LIVE dot, posted time, town) after
   window load, in idle time. On a failed or empty feed the static link stays. #}
<div class="live-banner" id="live-banner">
  <a class="live-banner-link" href="{{ '/live/' | url }}">Blue River Live →</a>
</div>
